+                                    # Persist injected skill IDs to instance
+                                    # metadata so SkillMetricsService can read
+                                    # them at task-completion time.
+                                    #
+                                    # Runs on BOTH branches — the branch
+                                    # that actually INJECTS skills (the
+                                    # ``injection_text`` truthy arm) is the
+                                    # one that matters: gating this persist
+                                    # on the "search yielded nothing" arm
